OL,3,GNEWSASlave memorial sculptures need
OL,4,Arecasting in bronze
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn artist with planning permission for
OL,7,Fa memorial to enslaved people in south
OL,8,FLondon is trying to raise the money to
OL,9,Fmake it permanent.
OL,11,FSokari Douglas Camp's All the World is
OL,12,FNow Richer is a set of six steel
OL,13,Ffigures, which Southwark Council has
OL,14,Fapproved for a site near Burgess Park.
OL,16,FTo stand outdoors for the long term,
OL,17,Fthe sculptures would need to be recast
OL,18,Fin bronze so the figures - and the
OL,19,Fwords they carry - do not weather away.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
